  {
   "id": "baby-steps-252502@3",
   "gameId": "baby-steps-252502",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 3",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-09-30T19:21:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The save game system will now use two additional backups that are written less often.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix key trophy falling through world",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for held items being pushed into geometry and causing a joint explosion.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix out of bounds in the crown dream.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix out of bounds in the propeller hat dream.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improve the fortress recovery ladder.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix Jim's well not staying closed upon reloading the area leading to a potential soft lock.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix being able to clip the trigger for the campfire cutscene in the apartment by going into the corner of the room causing nate to fall infinitely through the world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added gamma boost when you're far from your lantern in the dark in the fortress so it's easier to find your way back to it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix jagged river edges on low quality.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix entering a cutscene with the binoculars up causing the overlay to be on over the cutscene and Nate to be only floating eyes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix Nate being semi-transparent in a cutscene if you entered the cutscene with the camera inside him",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix breaking the vase before hearing from Mitchell causing an infinite Pause screen to appear.: -3 songs with extended tracks for more variation and better sounding \"fallen\" states: -5 new songs!: -snowier snow snogs: -one fewer songs bc there's a song in the song hospital: -wind gusts much less blast-y: -mix polish on a spoilery cutscene: Hello, Gabe here! This patch fixes an issue some people have had with their saves getting corrupted or lost after a crash . We have made it a lot safer, and hopefully this should never happen again. If anyone has lost their save and wants me to send them a save from an equivalent part of the game just @ me on the discord! So sorry about that I know how much it sucks in a game where progress can be so hard won!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
